    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6c4cecde12e6b2bb0b1684",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说抱负──呃，还好吗？你脸色有点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "371cff6facd734922f540fa772410d778e29c9a3305278dac5ec25bba66c0160",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "538"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a142d2598ff527828577b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们你当作目标的对象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd065493ad700887062846739f4a5483cbdac9c49891ab6235c3a1967a486b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "539"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a149cd48bee9aa4e7fe92a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉我们不会紧张的诀窍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59732d13f75b8d0e7fc6f69c9885498df4f4e48c077afad712c87913d5ea4185",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95ee9647dbf5078f0d690ab4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "简单来说，胜利的秘诀是！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff3d96bbce3120a567d96bf3ae2ad18e24a9b575869dce9c246816b2b26a51a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "540"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a62d10f97ade0c660a80b56",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好像有什么很香的味道？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ee03c12b1548c9f79f0fa872901f7196bf30d1940b29f6f57a35780306d842",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "541"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d448ef5e71093dbab2246826",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "家人是不是都会叫你「小多」之类的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c63cc737a969b6b3f0399ef0351ba13cbe1b4c417a80178eb9a5462678658cff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "542"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a1fad427f0727bbbb51a50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1398b3629ec121af8bef36cb0d63fda7a0ddfc5fdf5ca6d5c069bc57053bd1cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "543"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7f5cc27cf1a113f27dc0407",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你常看电视购物节目，最近有推荐的节目吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a818539d5b589a03f412535c0ac4ed8234cc0c90cb9cfc9821ff8a4d40b6ae4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "544"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1057f7c551d8cfe26968ac7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请用福冈腔说说抱负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfdd53bda620cc463cae579dd6ab0ad0d64b3035e07b8889cf54c07eb4802828",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "545"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dc118e76b0e70051eec2d4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待你能拿出安定感非凡的表现纵横赛场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07c3b87883ac1e9e7e574fc4e322c9c03474f31808e081bd173c05b4da82d687",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "546"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d02b4c5b45dd376026657369",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "针对竞赛做了多少跑步训练呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9897adb7b91482892537c91de7ad8363625284939dae0181f2f9c2afd871622",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "547"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ff9a33359a7a9e4198fcbc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近有遇到什么失误吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45bef4fc162d8dba4f1d45c120193a69c2d072eadbd0ee86be7228f3f7a2c397",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "548"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:454a396e54fdbaccdaa81a47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有竞赛和训练的日子都怎么度过？",
      "source_fingerprint": "983491826807b4f382b0c40de8281498dea0c3870d05ec066c4325f8f0c6a58a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "549"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb68e41673ecff8b5fe963d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对于本次战场的局势，你有何看法？",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f5d82d980377ff277a0274f03b13bde173f184012a5666000c7c1989f168d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3bc7ec1b1c753765114a687",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问即将触及顶点的现在是什么心情？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76b0de65072ea734ada183e10755a99d3c74e37db0cc5a666161754d37c18b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "550"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c73a92c21c25974bac48caf1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "迎接决赛的心境为何呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58c595fe2313f548ea50d79a6dd7cd3831699105ffb87896e5b35012ae48e688",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e00dc3260a7cba10031ab13b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在跑步这件事上有什么原则吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f4f905a830a6c1ac6ceb789e9021fee16da1263654650a33052af76c21b8736",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "552"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434c94d9eb5e3f5048f9a5fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛获胜的话会想要怎么样的奖励呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "996a1301ebb51f56e28f403fb681c545aaf6db34d8a01905a3eaecda0db66026",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "553"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba9a2ec2ac307594376b485",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会希望让谁看见这场胜负呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4361a7ccb772f13e9d75b6132631d5b86c9732ad5a22e36fa6bf493354b93dfa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "554"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14ec48186334adecbad0f62c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对劲敌们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ed748702a6491cfe604801b5ea9e6b2c41f1e94595cf3b9a87dd8692d7ffa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "555"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c37ec9470d2474ff034404ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对崇拜你的后辈们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80104f428486dfeef057f8e3e5976abc0ac50ec4b3c3ebcef5272c06843d1dca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "556"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a66a48f8d625e54d9f67555",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望我们在竞赛中关注哪些地方呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd7849ced480e4b1bd51f95942cca0e61df706efa0e533508ea511763c39c22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "557"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d3af98d8b580629db1b497",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以表演魔术给我们看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8012d9d6b71f6530db43efc0ec4ea77fce7ce39ee675065101eca9e94dc60024",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "558"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0092b51c4d99e657fe53ce1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1398b3629ec121af8bef36cb0d63fda7a0ddfc5fdf5ca6d5c069bc57053bd1cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "559"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337d0dea58e0d4db432e08b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在今天的竞赛当中，你最关注谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "730c865d805b9fa91a94a23df87e73266018693e5afd8a4a16048a040d6f0c62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbe6eacf8ff0b4f513fc0461",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得这场备受瞩目的竞赛，有什么新鲜之处吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e48ee7f7eb40fca1202a653b269388ba6913b2b0d91ff1686b16e6af020d83e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "560"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72c56b186a0253dd2f353bf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对在故乡守护你的大家说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e4b7db7bed10fc92201e1ab1494bac8c3e81a3e784e68b0ebda93c298fe5a04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd955729289d16cda0930b13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛在即，有什么担心的事情吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9d8cb4e45baa117eba49f3a1d38cd753c848cb1e7713a1437ed89a4bfd92119",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "562"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd80add49efb273fc1253401",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对劲敌们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ed748702a6491cfe604801b5ea9e6b2c41f1e94595cf3b9a87dd8692d7ffa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "563"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64cf5282cda4b22503ecbd2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会想替自己取什么别称？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d83f8284013a7e138db061a69256481cae624fc62b075e1b8c8b9cf78c827fe2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "564"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:496d13ea778507c76fedf785",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问目前状态大概达到百分之几呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec6a9bf23e285a06e9382c4de63f3cfe742d2c10c0be1edb7d9febbf84df85ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "565"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9611363d0707eb4dc497da9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛有令你感到不安的地方吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "296055d77ce0f5606ca0e5e289ebbcc034f091d4bef086429954f8a02b995487",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "566"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ed3bfd9d6ca8cf96b1cdfed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各方皆预期会是场激战，请问你的心境是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "649a52eb745efcd728402fc74adda338ace6a1fb0360566061b3ecf010590b8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "567"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a1ffefcc67c4c3af8598fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在决赛中会让我们见识到怎么样的表现呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb9f7adc4539303ee1d4688547461581016dbc599b6dcf378c343eb89c78ccb2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "568"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afeddc463895181afe3b9b18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对位于美国的双亲说些话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f973e65242045cd8579052c9e4e3e6f86ceb11d66d24f6d20d632945cdfc60b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "569"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcfb11cd4be257269793b14e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你觉得获得胜利的关键是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6f0f6923974db5a4ee56377b83affcaa6889a878fe6abbf9aed76532e60449",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "57"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68a37ff72d64911258278d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次的竞赛，会是高手云集吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "70fa1115ea526e0c1b0ade626b106dc064ad27604cca9ca6ef1270eea54766a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "570"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4df3c09779a1fb8b31a6010d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就快到决赛了，状况如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9630e42d5c9d012871840bbd197b921fb58e1c9b32eae3a940fe02875fb56c78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:630865b9e08d6728f5727799",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会觉得紧张吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b6efe49e3ea4e77f0d196cc0d23da9389f3adb0d159bc4709603985686340a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "572"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9cd563ba935064e070ead6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说句对竞赛的期许！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f20d393858cbc5eaf3229ddae5ded6b3983386e8bee9612434b8571a9f807ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "573"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2685edab6bd32838f7a59ee4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于要到决赛了！请问有必胜策略吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d88104f794712b75f5301f13765d21a1cb814effaf45543f4e29abe49d104949",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "574"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc59a743520c69b0d63ec40e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "确定进入决赛时的心情是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeed2d1aaba4a387efdc6d471008d546eaf7edfb7138db95466193d349ee3be3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "575"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3758a6fdd1fd4e8396c82132",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问对这场竞赛有多少把握？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5bc11f0dbcf1ecd3bc3a8206ce1465a8786d2069e0f2f3f80dd7a024eb69b64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "576"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f793ab13900b2f723f7ff41",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若获得优胜，会希望能被谁夸奖呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "33902c5d31bd104559882c827e0a337896169cdddd2a9b5da5b1d24befe64325",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "577"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e163c9f7af061a03eac390",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望我们在决赛中关注哪些地方呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "34bf4fd0809bc18a88085e3ca03a4c1277d3b54932d57ff9c62b874dd802e403",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
